sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Monitoring Daemon
    participant AI as AI Runtime
    participant P as Policy Engine
    participant O as Optimizers
    participant K as Linux Kernel
    M->>AI: 1s telemetry window
    AI->>AI: LSTM + RF + anomaly scoring
    AI->>P: Predicted overload and confidence
    P->>O: Ranked optimization actions
    O->>K: Affinity, priority, memory, power actions
    K->>M: Feedback metrics
    M->>AI: Post-action telemetry
